{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112593","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112593/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112593/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112593/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112593","id":3605322160,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6yZLk2","number":112593,"title":"Don't redraw `Sprite3D`/`AnimatedSprite3D` outside the tree","user":{"login":"kleonc","id":9283098,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkyODMwOTg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9283098?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc","html_url":"https://github.com/kleonc","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"ff6055","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1647053200,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxNjQ3MDUzMjAw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/cherrypick:3.x","name":"cherrypick:3.x","color":"446699","default":false,"description":"Considered for cherry-picking into a future 3.x release","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708289,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4Mjg5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:3d","name":"topic:3d","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/23","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23/labels","id":12939969,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AxXLB","number":23,"title":"4.6","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":2978,"state":"closed","created_at":"2025-05-22T16:25:52Z","updated_at":"2026-10-04T16:23:23Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":"2026-01-26T18:09:14Z"},"comments":3,"created_at":"2025-11-09T18:35:56Z","updated_at":"2026-01-16T16:09:15Z","closed_at":"2025-11-26T22:49:26Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/112593","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112593","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112593.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112593.patch","merged_at":"2025-11-26T22:49:25Z"},"body":"Fixes #112566.\r\n\r\nEnsures `SpriteBase3D::parent_sprite` is set on `NOTIFICATION_PARENTED`/`NOTIFICATION_UNPARENTED` instead of on `NOTIFICATION_ENTER_TREE`/`NOTIFICATION_EXIT_TREE`. This was already enough to fix #112566 as the bug happened because `SpriteBase3D::_draw()` was called before the sprites entered the tree:\r\n- the redraw was queued when outside the tree, during scene instantiation when setting stored color/texture,\r\n- the `MessageQueue` was flushed before entering the tree, during physics processing (it's irrelevant where exactly),\r\n- the child sprite's dirty-marked color was updated as if it had no parent, and was marked as not dirty anymore with such incorrect cumulated-color,\r\n- scene was changed \"at the end of a frame\" (scene changes are deferred on their own, independent of `MessageQueue`/`call_deffered` calls).\r\n\r\nMoreover, after the above there was another redraw triggered, as on `NOTIFICATION_ENTER_TREE` it would update/redraw immediately in case no redraw is enqueued, which was the case when reloading the scene (the another redraw would use wrong cumulated-color for the child sprite).\r\n\r\nRedrawing being triggered when outside the tree seems pointless to me. :thinking:\r\nHence I've made it not update when outside the tree, and update immediately on entering the tree. This makes e.g. on reloading the scene as in the MRP from #112566 the `SpriteBase3D::_draw()` be called only once per Sprite3D (instead of twice, including the first one outside the tree).","closed_by":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112593/reactions","total_count":4,"+1":4,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112593/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}